meta {
  name: cancel a class
  type: http
  seq: 11
}

post {
  url: {{base_url}}/student/sessions/:id/cancel/
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

params:path {
  id: fd36207a-5413-48bc-809e-f5d229d971bb
}

docs {
  ## API explanation
  Cancels a scheduled class. No body.

  The cancellation policy shown before payment is enforced here: cancelling more
  than `RESCHEDULE_CUTOFF_HOURS` (24) before the class returns the class to the
  package (`class_returned: true`); cancelling inside that window forfeits it
  (`class_returned: false`). Either way the slot goes back on the teacher's
  calendar and the pending reminder is cancelled.

  Only a `scheduled` class can be cancelled -- anything else returns 400.

  ## API example response
  {
    "success": true,
    "class_returned": true,
    "message": "Your class has been cancelled and returned to your package."
  }
}
